    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Oburuchi bwaAhazi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumuyika kwekhumi namusaafu kwaPeka waRemalia, Ahazi waYotsamu, omuruchi waYuda, yachaaka okhuruka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahazi yali owemiyika amakhumi kabili olwa yachaaka okhuruka, naruchila eYerusalemu emiyika ekhumi nachisasaba; ne shiyakhola akali amalayi mumoni tsiOMWAMI Nyasayewe, shinga Daudi kuukanyene, ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habula yachenda munjila tsiabaruchi baIsiraeli; kata yabisia omwanawe mumulilo, ebisinyo biabamahanga shinga olwa biali, aba OMWAMI yarusia imbeli wabaana baIsiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi yamalila emisango nasambila amalesi kelibuuliesi habundu aheechingu hosi, nokhubikulu, nomubuli musaala omutendeemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Rezini, omuruchi waSiria, nende Peka waRemalia, omuruchi waIsiraeli, nibatikulukha nibeetsa eYerusalemu okhuliseera; nibeekalila Ahazi, ne bakhaywa okhumuhula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mundaalo etsio omuruchi waEdomu yakalusilia Edomu Elatsi, niyeelusia abaYuda abali muElatsi; nabo abaEdomu nibeetsa eElatsi, nibamenyayo okhuula olwa leelo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Ahazi nakhupila Tigilatsi-pileseri omuruchi waAshuru omunwa, ari Nisie omusumbawo khandi omwanawo; otikulushe, ureesie mumukhono kwomuruchi waSiria khandi mumukhono kwomuruchi waIsiraeli, abaseerile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahazi nabukula ifeetsa neitsahaabu eyanyoolekha munzu yOMWAMI, khandi mumabiishilo akomunzu yomuruchi, natsiyilila omuruchi waAshuru tsibe eshihaanwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye omuruchi waAshuru namuhulila; omuruchi waAshuru natikulukha naseera Damasiko, nalibukula, niyaara abandu balio, nabayila eKiri, namwira Rezini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwa omuruchi Ahazi yatsia eDamasiko okhwakaanila Tigilatsi-pileseri, omuruchi waAshuru, yalola eshimalilo shiemisango eshiali nishilieDamasiko; kho omuruchi Ahazi naruma omundu okhumanyia Uriya omukuhani imbia yeshimalilo eshio shinga olwa yali, nomufwano kwashio, obukasibwi bwashio bwosi shinga olwa bwali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Uriya omukuhani niyoombakha eshimalilo; shinga kosi aka omuruchi Ahazi yali narumile okhurula eDamasiko olwa kali, nolwa Uriya omukuhani yashikhola, omuruchi Ahazi nashili okhukalukha okhurula eDamasiko, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana olwa omuruchi yali nakaluushe okhurula eDamasiko, omuruchi yatsia okhulola eshimalilo; omuruchi nasita ahambi khushimalilo eshio nashiniinakhwo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nasambilakhwo omusangokwe omusambe, nomusangokwe kweimele, natsukha omusangokwe kwokhutsushila, niyooha amalasile kemisangochie chiokhwishia khushio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nashio eshimalilo shiomukasa eshiali imbeli w, yashirusia aha shiali hambeli munzu, hakari weshimalilo shishie nende inzu yOMWAMI, nashira khulubeka lwanotsi Iweshimalilo shishie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana omuruchi Ahazi nalaka Uriya omukuhani ari Khushimalilo eshikhongo osambilenjekhwo omusango omusambe kwomutsuli, nomusango kweimele kwomungoloobe, nomusango omusambe kwomuruchi, nomusangokwe kweimele, halala nomusango omusambe kwabandu bosi beshialo, nomusango kwabwe kweimele, nemisango chiabwe chiokhutsushila; niwohakhwo amalasile kosi komusango omusambe, namalasile kosi komusango kundi; habula eshimalilo shiomukasa shibe eshianje eshiokhureebelakhwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uriya omukuhani nakhola ario, kosi aka omuruchi Ahazi yalaka shinga olwa kali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana omuruchi Ahazi yakhalaka obwala ebitonye biabwo ebiabotokhanwa orubaho, narusiakhwo olutaabo Iwokhusaaba; khandi niyeesia inyanza tsana okhurula khung'ombe tsiomukasa etsiali hasi wayo, nachira khumachina akaalwa hasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nayo injila yeshilama eyeisabato eya bali niboombashila munzu, nobwinjililo bwomuruchi bwelwanyi, yabishiukhasilia inzu yOMWAMI, khulwa amakhuwa komuruchi waAshuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne amakhuwa kandi kaAhazi aka yakhola, shikahandiikwa muShitabu shiAmakhuwa keTsindaalo akabaruchi baYuda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Ahazi nakona, nalonda khubakuukanyene, nayabilwa halala nabakuukanyene mwitookho liaDaudi; naye Hezekia omwanawe naruka mushilenieshie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
